Bright Souls Eve is a winter holiday of [[Geography/Færrin/Calaria/index|Calaria]], kept with gifts and parties. Snow lies in the streets of [[Geography/Færrin/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]] through it, and the aurora of the [[Iridescent Host|Host]] shows overhead.
